Package: henge-guest
Version: 1.3.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Henge <henge@localhost>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, util-linux, cloud-guest-utils, gdisk, e2fsprogs, davfs2, python3, tzdata
Recommends: wl-clipboard, xclip
Description: Henge guest tools
 Grows the root partition and file system to the disk on every boot,
 does the one-time first-boot setup, mounts the shared folder at ~/Henge,
 shares the clipboard with the device on the desktop, and follows the
 device's clock, time zone and screen brightness.
